   "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"format-detection\" content=\"telephone=no\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light only\">\n<meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light only\">\n<title>Wonka Bootcamp, Day 8: The Tasting Room</title>\n<style>\n  /* Progressive enhancement only. Every rule below has a working inline\n     equivalent, so an inbox that strips this block still renders correctly. */\n  @media only screen and (max-width:620px) {\n    .px   { padding-left:22px !important; padding-right:22px !important; }\n    .h1   { font-size:25px !important; line-height:1.25 !important; }\n    .h2   { font-size:18.5px !important; }\n    .btn  { display:block !important; padding:16px 20px !important; }\n    .tile { display:block !important; width:100% !important; }\n    .capT { padding-top:22px !important; }\n    .capB { padding-bottom:26px !important; }\n  }\n  a { color:#8A5A1E; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#F3E9D2;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all\">See how your new images compare with the images currently live on Amazon.</div>\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all\">&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#F3E9D2;width:100%\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:32px 12px\">\n<!--[if mso]><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"620\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td><![endif]-->\n<div style=\"max-width:620px;margin:0 auto\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;background:#FFFCF4;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 26px rgba(31,16,8,.10)\">\n\n  <tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"background:#2B1439;padding:20px 46px;border-bottom:3px solid #E4B46C\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n      <td style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#E4B46C;font-weight:700;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">THE WONKA CREATIVE BOOTCAMP</td>\n      <td align=\"right\" style=\"font-size:20px\">&#127913;</td>\n    </tr></table>\n  </td></tr>\n\n  <tr><td class=\"px capT\" style=\"padding:40px 46px 0\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:11.5px;color:#E4B46C;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2em\">DAY 8 OF 10</p>\n    <h1 class=\"h1\" style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:31px;font-weight:700;color:#1F1008;line-height:1.22;letter-spacing:-.4px\">The Tasting Room</h1>\n  </td></tr>\n\n  <tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:24px 46px 0\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#3F2A18\">Day 8 is now open.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#3F2A18\">Today, your images will enter the Tasting Room.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#3F2A18\">A panel of approximately 100 AI buyer personas based on your target customer profile will compare your new images with the images currently live on your Amazon listing.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#3F2A18\">Wonka will organize the results and show you what the panel preferred, which parts of the new set were strongest, and which objections or weaknesses still need attention.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#3F2A18\">If your current images win, that is still useful information. Day 8 is one sitting: both races, then the fixes Wonka draws from the panel's notes. A second tasting round happens only when the first came back without a clear lead.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:8px 0 24px\"><a href=\"https://jaygptpro.com/wonka-bootcamp/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#E4B46C;color:#241A10;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;padding:16px 38px;border-radius:50px;letter-spacing:.3px\">Open Day 8 &rarr;</a></td></tr></table>\n  </td></tr>\n\n  <tr><td class=\"px capB\" style=\"padding:30px 46px 38px\">\n    <div style=\"height:2px;background:#E4B46C;opacity:.55;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:0;line-height:0\">&nbsp;</div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#8A7862;font-weight:700\">Jay Margaliot</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:3px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#8A7862\">The Wonka Creative Bootcamp &middot; <a href=\"mailto:info@jaygptpro.com\" style=\"color:#8A7862\">info@jaygptpro.com</a></p>\n    <p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-size:11.5px;color:#B6A794;line-height:1.6\">You are receiving this because you have a seat in the September round. <a href=\"mailto:info@jaygptpro.com?subject=Unsubscribe%20from%20Wonka%20Bootcamp%20emails\" style=\"color:#B6A794\">Unsubscribe</a></p>\n  </td></tr>\n\n</table>\n</div>\n<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n</td></tr></table></body></html>"
